        "id": 222276,
        "name": "dpt",
        "username": "dpt",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-10-22T11:36:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"kazaasaky\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/e68b1a/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> kazaasaky:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>ward the shore senario question.</p>\n<p>'stage 3 surge :During Stage III, Explore adds 1 town&nbsp;&nbsp;in addition to the usual 1 exploror\"</p>\n<p>is mean stage 3 means invader card?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"kazaasaky\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/e68b1a/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> kazaasaky:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If there are no invaders on the land to be invaded, and the exploration conditions are met. that land&nbsp;add 1 exploror + 1 town&nbsp;“in every stage 3 invader card?”</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes. (This happens whether or not there are invaders there, as long as exploration conditions are met.)</p>",
