      {
        "id": 222280,
        "name": "grysqrl",
        "username": "grysqrl",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/grysqrl/{size}/1909_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-15T15:02:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Adriaan:</p>\n<p>You can't skip the \"Gather up to 3 Dahan\" instruction, but \"up to 3\" includes 0. So you can follow the \"Gather up to 3 Dahan\" instruction without actually gathering any Dahan.</p>\n<p>On the other hand, if the power said \"Gather 3 Dahan. Push up to 3 Dahan.\" then you would have to gather 3 Dahan (or as many were available, up to 3) and then push 0-3 Dahan.</p>",
